 "text": "Recorder | Beltrami County\nThis website uses cookies to enhance usability and provide you with a more personal experience. By using this website, you agree to our use of cookies as explained in our Privacy Policy.\nAgree\nSkip to main content\nSkip to footer\nBeltrami County\nMenu\nLiving Here\nExpand sub pages Living Here\nAddressing\nApplications, Licenses Permits Forms\nElections & Voting\nRecycling and Waste\nMaps\nNewsletter\nParks & Recreation\nReal Estate & Property Tax Services\nPublic Drainage Ditches\nReport a Problem\nRoads & Bridges\nVisit Bemidji\nServices\nExpand sub pages Services\nBirth, Death, & Marriage Records\nCareers\nDMV\nEmployment Services\nMaps\nPassport Services\nPublic Assistance\nPublic Health\nPublic Safety & Law Enforcement\nSocial Services\nVeterans Services\nBusiness & Development\nExpand sub pages Business & Development\nApplications, Licenses, Permits & Forms\nEnvironmental Services\nLand Records / Recorded Documents\nOrdinances\nProperty Management Portal for Businesses\nTax Forfeited Land Sales\nTimber Sales\nOur Government\nExpand sub pages Our Government\nAgendas and Minutes\nBoard of Commissioners\nBuildings and Locations\nCommunity Health Board\nContact Us\nCounty Attorney\nElected Officials\nFinancial Documents\nNews and Notices\nNewsletters\nNotary Commission\nUMN Extension\nDepartments\nExpand sub pages Departments\nAdministration\nAssessor\nAttorney\nAuditor-Treasurer\nEnvironmental Services\nFacilities Management\nGIS\nHealth & Human Services\nHuman Resources\nIT Department\nNatural Resource Management\nPublic Works Department - Highway Division\nPublic Works Department - Recycling & Waste Division\nRecorder\nSheriff's Office\nVeterans Services\n| ×\n|\n| Search |\n|\nExpand Search\nBeltrami County\nRecorder and Registrar of Titles\nSection Menu\nMission\nThe mission of our office is to serve the public with the highest quality of customer service we can offer while protecting, preserving and recording or filing of all documents in a secure manner that is both timely and cost effective.\nResponsibilities & Services\nThe County Recorder/Registrar of Titles is the custodian of all legal records accepted and recorded/filed in Beltrami County pertaining to Real Estate. These records are permanently preserved in an archival quality format and are made accessible to the public.\nRecording deeds, mortgages, satisfactions and approximately 200 types of legal documents.\nOriginating Certificates of Title conveying land under Torrens Land System\nRecording military service discharges and issuing certified copies\nRecording of federal and state tax liens\nRecording bankruptcy documents, power of attorney, and farm names.\nRecords all official plats\nLand Records/Recorded Documents\nDepartments\nRecorder\nToggle Menu Html.Raw(currentTopLevel.Value (\"subNavigationLinkText\")).ToString() : currentTopLevel.Name)\nRecorder\nView Full Menu\nToggle Menu Recorder\nAdministration\nToggle Section\nLocal Sales & Use Tax\nAssessor\nToggle Section\nDisabled Veterans Exclusion\nAttorney\nAuditor-Treasurer\nEnvironmental Services\nFacilities Management\nGIS\nToggle Section\nAbout Beltrami County GIS\nProperty Mapping\nHealth & Human Services\nHuman Resources\nToggle Section\nEmployee Access\nToggle Section\nEmployee Access Highway\nIT Department\nNatural Resource Management\nToggle Section\nForest Management\nPermits\nToggle Section\nSalvage Permits\nBalsam Bough Permits\nMaple Syrup Permits\nPublic Works Department - Highway Division\nPublic Works Department - Recycling & Waste Division\nSheriff's Office\nVeterans Services\nContact Us\nBeltrami County Recorder\n701 Minnesota Ave NW Ste 120\nBemidji, MN 56601\nPhone: 218-333-8345 or\n218-333-4170\nEmail\nHours: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm\nMon - Fri\nHome\nDepartments\nRecorder\nContact Us\nCounty Administration\n701 Minnesota Ave. NW\nBemidji, MN 56601\nwebmaster@beltramicountymn.gov\nDepartment Directory\nResources\nSitemap\nPrivacy Policy\nCareers\nEmployee Access\nConnect With Us\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\nYoutube\n© 2026 Beltrami County\nMade with\nGovstack\nBack to top\n| |",
